、max_depth… 都是 CART 的超參數"], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}], "desc": "講義 p129 比較表重點：分枝準則、分枝方式、剪枝、缺值處理", "ref": "PART03 p129–134", "chapter": "C4.5 vs CART（還有 ID3、CHAID）"}, {"id": "a2", "title": "作業二的程式部分：把流程印出來", "els": [{"x": 150, "y": 210, "w": 1000, "h": 560, "title": "a2_tree.py（示意）", "size": 24, "cells": [{"at": 1, "code": ["def tree_growth(E, F, depth=0):", "    if stopping_cond(E, F):", "        return Leaf(classify(E))", "    for A in F:          # 每個候選屬性", "        print(A, gini(E, A), ig(E, A), gain_ratio(E, A))", "    best = find_best_split(E, F)", "    node = Node(best)", "    for v, Ev in split(E, best):", "        node.add(v, tree_growth(Ev, F, depth + 1))", "    return node"]}], "type": "code"}, {"x": 286, "y": 385, "w": 840, "h": 74, "col": "B", "at": 2, "type": "hl"}, {"x": 1210, "y": 210, "w": 560, "h": 260, "title": "對應虛擬碼", "col": "A", "at": 1, "body": ["stopping_cond → 葉子", "find_best_split → 挑屬性", "for v → 遞迴"], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}, {"x": 1210, "y": 500, "w": 560, "h": 270, "title": "助教要看的", "col": "B", "at": 2, "body": ["每個節點：各屬性的", "Gini／IG／Gain Ratio", {"s": "程式碼 → Word 附錄", "at": 3}], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}], "desc": "作業二 (d) 用程式做：每個節點印出候選屬性的 Gini／IG／Gain Ratio，選最好的再遞迴", "ref": "PART03 p135–136", "chapter": "作業二：程式部分怎麼對應虛擬碼", "tag": "作業二 11/11", "tagCol": "B"}, {"id": "mistakes", "title": "常見誤區", "els": [{"x": 150, "y": 210, "w": 1620, "size": 30, "gap": 14, "items": [{"s": "Classify ＝ 多數決（argmax p(i|t)）", "at": 1, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "回歸樹：葉子給平均值；分裂看變異數降低", "at": 2, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "決策樹不用標準化（只比大小、找切點）", "at": 3, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "一般決策樹只能直切、橫切，不會斜切", "at": 4, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "C4.5：增益比、多元分枝；CART：Gini、二元分枝", "at": 5, "col": "BAD"}], "type": "bullets"}], "desc": "五張紅色警示卡", "ref": "PART03 p98–134", "chapter": "常見誤區"}, {"id": "quiz", "title": "小測驗", "els": [{"y": 215, "qs": [{"q": "Q1　葉子 (2, 5)，Classify 給什麼標籤？", "a": "類別 1（5/7 最大，多數決）", "qi": 1, "ai": 2}, {"q": "Q2　回歸樹用什麼量「純不純」？", "a": "變異數（選變異數降低最多的）", "qi": 3, "ai": 4}, {"q":